        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-13T09:13:21.343Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"20476\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>All I know is I came up with the Savage Quokka and I will ride that freight train to my grave. :B</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>For those who don’t know on Critical Role Ashley’s druid wild shaped into a Quokka since it was small like a rat, but cute so people would not instinctively kill it.<br>\nthat led to 5 minutes of people looking up Quokka pictures and facts on their phones<br>\nepisode 5 of four-sided dive also had a Quokka joke</p>",
